[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="DebtLetters" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-340, -284)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Letters"
flag_to_set = "ashdown_debt_letters_read"
discovery_text = "[b]Letters on the writing desk[/b]

A neat pile, each folded the same way, each with the Merchants' Guild seal broken.
\"[i]My lady, the Guild is mindful of your late father's friendship, and patient. But a hundred gold does not grow smaller with patience...[/i]\"
\"[i]...the valley venture continues to answer our hopes. Each season of trouble lowers the price of an acre further...[/i]\"

All signed with the same looped initials: [i]H.M.[/i]"
reexamine_text = "The Guild is patient. The valley venture lowers the price."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/DebtLetters"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_190x46")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/DebtLetters"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -90.0
offset_top = -56.0
offset_right = 90.0
offset_bottom = -31.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Read the Letters"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="DeedCaseGlass" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(330, -300)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Deed"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The Western Valley deed[/b]

Under glass, the ancient grant of House Ashdown, its royal seal cracked with age.

Beside it, not under glass, a newer map of Thornhaven, every freehold drawn in. Some are shaded. Beside each shaded parcel a price is pencilled, and the prices fall season by season: [i]Brannoc's farm, 96 silver. 53. 22. Bought, 14.[/i]"
reexamine_text = "Thornhaven, acre by acre, bought cheap."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/DeedCaseGlass"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_150x46")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/DeedCaseGlass"]
